---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
import { pageLang } from '../../../utils/lang';

const ru = pageLang(Astro.url) === 'ru';

// Two boards of ten marks each, scattered loosely.
// Positions are relative to a 240 x 130 board.
type Mark = { kind: 'O' | 'X'; x: number; y: number };
const boardA: Mark[] = [
  { kind: 'O', x: 30, y: 32 }, { kind: 'X', x: 70, y: 36 }, { kind: 'O', x: 108, y: 34 },
  { kind: 'X', x: 146, y: 24 }, { kind: 'O', x: 200, y: 32 }, { kind: 'O', x: 46, y: 68 },
  { kind: 'X', x: 150, y: 62 }, { kind: 'X', x: 40, y: 104 }, { kind: 'X', x: 84, y: 104 },
  { kind: 'O', x: 126, y: 100 },
];
const boardB: Mark[] = [
  { kind: 'O', x: 42, y: 30 }, { kind: 'O', x: 92, y: 34 }, { kind: 'O', x: 146, y: 28 },
  { kind: 'X', x: 196, y: 30 }, { kind: 'O', x: 36, y: 66 }, { kind: 'O', x: 84, y: 70 },
  { kind: 'O', x: 128, y: 62 }, { kind: 'O', x: 58, y: 104 }, { kind: 'O', x: 112, y: 102 },
  { kind: 'O', x: 166, y: 100 },
];

const count = (board: Mark[], kind: 'O' | 'X') => board.filter((m) => m.kind === kind).length;
const entropyBits = (ps: number[]) => ps.reduce((s, p) => (p > 0 ? s - p * Math.log2(p) : s), 0);

const boards = [boardA, boardB].map((marks, i) => {
  const nO = count(marks, 'O');
  const nX = count(marks, 'X');
  const n = nO + nX;
  const pX = nX / n;
  return {
    name: i === 0 ? (ru ? "Поле A" : "Board A") : (ru ? "Поле B" : "Board B"),
    marks,
    nO,
    nX,
    pO: `${nO}/${n}`,
    pX: `${nX}/${n}`,
    surpriseX: -Math.log2(pX),
    H: entropyBits([nO / n, nX / n]),
  };
});
const f3 = (v: number) => v.toFixed(3).replace(/\.?0+$/, '');
const f2 = (v: number) => v.toFixed(2).replace(/\.?0+$/, '');

const W = 240;
const H = 130;
// Wide layout: boards side by side. Narrow layout: stacked.
const wide = [
  { ox: 30, oy: 44 },
  { ox: 340, oy: 44 },
];
const narrow = [
  { ox: 60, oy: 40 },
  { ox: 60, oy: 352 },
];
const lineGap = 25;
---

<Figure
  id="entropy-and-divergences-boards"
  title={ru ? "На каком поле вытянуть X неожиданнее?" : "Where is drawing an X more surprising?"}
  caption={ru ? "На обоих полях по десять значков. На поле B крестик редок (1 из 10), поэтому вытянуть его неожиданнее, а само поле в целом более предсказуемо: его энтропия, средняя неожиданность, которую мы определим в следующем разделе, ниже, чем у сбалансированного поля A." : "Both boards hold ten marks. On board B a cross is rare (1 in 10), so drawing it is more surprising, while the board as a whole is more predictable: its entropy, the average surprise defined in the next section, is lower than that of the balanced board A."}
>
  {[{ cls: 'fig-wide fig-medium', vb: '0 0 610 312', pos: wide, sfx: 'w' }, { cls: 'fig-narrow', vb: '0 0 360 630', pos: narrow, sfx: 'n' }].map((layout) => (
    <svg class={layout.cls} viewBox={layout.vb} role="img" aria-labelledby={`entropy-and-divergences-boards-${layout.sfx}-t entropy-and-divergences-boards-${layout.sfx}-d`}>
      <title id={`entropy-and-divergences-boards-${layout.sfx}-t`}>{ru ? "Два поля с ноликами и крестиками" : "Two boards of noughts and crosses"}</title>
      <desc id={`entropy-and-divergences-boards-${layout.sfx}-d`}>{ru ? "На поле A пять ноликов и пять крестиков, поэтому P(O) = P(X) = 1/2; вытянутый X несёт 1 бит неожиданности, а энтропия равна 1 биту. На поле B девять ноликов и один крестик, поэтому P(O) = 9/10 и P(X) = 1/10; вытянутый X несёт 3.32 бита неожиданности, а энтропия равна 0.469 бита." : "Board A has five noughts and five crosses, so P(O) = P(X) = 1/2; drawing an X carries 1 bit of surprise and the entropy is 1 bit. Board B has nine noughts and one cross, so P(O) = 9/10 and P(X) = 1/10; drawing the X carries 3.32 bits of surprise and the entropy is 0.469 bits."}</desc>
      {layout.sfx === 'w' && <text class="f-title" x="305" y={44 + H / 2 + 6} text-anchor="middle">{ru ? 'или' : 'vs'}</text>}
      {boards.map((b, i) => {
        const { ox, oy } = layout.pos[i];
        const cx = ox + W / 2;
        const ty = oy + H + 30;
        return (
          <g>
            <rect class="f-box" x={ox} y={oy} width={W} height={H} rx="6" />
            <text class="f-title" x={ox + 8} y={oy - 7}>{b.name}</text>
            {b.marks.map((m) =>
              m.kind === 'O' ? (
                <circle class="f-line f-blue" cx={ox + m.x} cy={oy + m.y} r="9" />
              ) : (
                <path class="f-line f-red" d={`M ${ox + m.x - 8} ${oy + m.y - 8} L ${ox + m.x + 8} ${oy + m.y + 8} M ${ox + m.x + 8} ${oy + m.y - 8} L ${ox + m.x - 8} ${oy + m.y + 8}`} />
              ),
            )}
            <text class="f-label" x={cx} y={ty} text-anchor="middle">
              <tspan class="f-t-blue" fill="var(--fig-blue)">#O = {b.nO}</tspan>
              <tspan dx="14" fill="var(--fig-red)">#X = {b.nX}</tspan>
            </text>
            <text class="f-math" x={cx} y={ty + lineGap} text-anchor="middle">P(O) = {b.pO},  P(X) = {b.pX}</text>
            <text class="f-label" x={cx} y={ty + 2 * lineGap} text-anchor="middle">{ru ? 'неожиданность X: ' : 'surprise of X: '}<tspan font-weight="650">{f2(b.surpriseX)} {ru ? (b.surpriseX === 1 ? 'бит' : 'бита') : `bit${b.surpriseX === 1 ? '' : 's'}`}</tspan></text>
            <text class="f-label" x={cx} y={ty + 3 * lineGap} text-anchor="middle">{ru ? 'энтропия H = ' : 'entropy H = '}<tspan font-weight="650">{f3(b.H)} {ru ? (b.H === 1 ? 'бит' : 'бита') : `bit${b.H === 1 ? '' : 's'}`}</tspan></text>
          </g>
        );
      })}
      {layout.sfx === 'w' ? (
        <g>
          <text class="f-note f-t-red" x="580" y="16" text-anchor="end">{ru ? "редкий X: большая неожиданность" : "the rare X: high surprise"}</text>
          <path class="f-thin f-red" d="M 560 22 Q 566 46 544 64" marker-end="url(#f-arrow-red)" />
        </g>
      ) : (
        <g>
          <text class="f-note f-t-red" x="300" y="324" text-anchor="end">{ru ? "редкий X: большая неожиданность" : "the rare X: high surprise"}</text>
          <path class="f-thin f-red" d="M 290 330 Q 300 352 266 370" marker-end="url(#f-arrow-red)" />
        </g>
      )}
    </svg>
  ))}
</Figure>
